00:26:52.860 --> 00:26:55.290
so they could use it more
flexibly to support complex

00:26:55.290 --> 00:26:58.580
elective surgery, a real
learning from the pandemic there.

00:26:58.580 --> 00:27:00.390
At Lymington New Forest Hospital,

00:27:00.390 --> 00:27:03.300
they showed how they're linking
up services like endoscopy

00:27:03.300 --> 00:27:06.452
audiology with their
community diagnostic centre

00:27:06.452 --> 00:27:08.570
to deliver literally thousands

00:27:08.570 --> 00:27:10.700
